The Arena's bracket bout is behind you; the crowd is still deciding how to feel about it. Madam Thessaly Vance is not. Velvet, ledgers, a smile like a closing door.
thessaly_vance: Congratulations. You're somebody now — which is the worst thing that can happen to a person in this city.
thessaly_vance: There. You're on the rolls. Eight regions, nine clans, one empty sky. The warm green Glut's the kindest door — the Bloomwardens keep the friendliest embassy and they'll take a Stranger gently. Off you pop.
thessaly_vance: (lighter, which is worse) Oh — and a file's been opened under your name. In the Reliquary. Purely procedural. Do keep climbing. The view from up there is exactly as lonely as they say.
[The bells of Threshold ring you in. Somewhere, a ledger adds a line. Somewhere else, a chair you've never seen gets very slightly warmer.]
